      "identified_speaker": "Charlie",
      "similarity_score": 0.9744089527786268
    },
    {
      "start": 176.543,
      "end": 184.268,
      "text": "It is obviously unnecessary for us to point out how luminous these criticisms are, how delicate and expression",
